			<zone xml:id="p2z12-0" points="1219,1948 1360,1926 1478,1966 1615,1896 1923,1939 2070,1913 2071,1850 1947,1812 1221,1869">1227,1907 1269,1904 1311,1904 1354,1904 1396,1901 1438,1901 1481,1901 1523,1899 1565,1898 1608,1896 1650,1895 1692,1894 1735,1892 1777,1891 1819,1889 1862,1889 1904,1888 1946,1886 1989,1889 2031,1892 2074,1898</zone>
